#ASSERT `ch 2 -- the heir has his inheritance on payment of the ancient relief` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `Entitlement not covered` -- S29,S30 [2.1] socage tenant of the King, or a mesne tenant: not covered
